{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":1277,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Consumables"]}]},"\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Consumables"]}," are items that can be used during a match to provide an immediate, helpful effect. They are obtained by opening one of the three tiers of consumable crates, with powerful ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Consumables"]}," having a higher rarity and a lower chance to be obtained. The effects of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Consumables"]}," are different for each, meaning they will apply buffs for towers, deal heavy damage or slow down the enemies."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Consumables"]}," are equipped similar to towers in a separate hotbar, allowing up to four different consumables to be brought into a match. There is a limit to how many consumables can be used in a match, with each consumable having a cooldown between uses and from the start of the match. ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Consumables"]}," can be used in most matches unless the mode that is being played, such as ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hardcore_Mode","title":"Hardcore Mode"},"children":["Hardcore"]}," mode does not allow them."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["There are two types of consumables, PVE and PVP. PVE can be used in most modes as long as they do not disable consumables. PVP consumables can only be used in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/PVP_Test","title":"PVP Test"},"children":["PVP Test"]},". Both types have separate loadouts and interact with the game differently, with PVE mostly being used to debuff enemies or support your towers while PVP consumables make enem